      </table>
      <div class="callout callout-warning" style="margin-top:16px;">
        <div class="callout-title">Pricing Disconnect</div>
        Electricity price shows virtually no correlation with either demand or renewable availability. Current dynamic pricing is not responsive to grid conditions, representing a missed opportunity for demand shaping and renewable incentivization.
      </div>
