      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="callout callout-insight" style="margin-top:16px;">
      <div class="callout-title">Optimization Drivers</div>
      The optimization reward is most strongly driven by three factors: higher renewable ratio (+0.59), lower station load (-0.58), and lower waiting time (-0.52). Electricity price has no meaningful influence (+0.01). This confirms that grid stress reduction and renewable integration are the primary levers for optimization, not pricing signals.
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== SECTION 5: VEHICLE BEHAVIOR ===== -->
